  "bodyHash": "0CRnjmbQG8E=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">原项目将很快更新，请密切关注<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方页面</a>！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">这是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish的枪械模组</a>的非官方移植版本，<strong>需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">框架模组</a></strong>。</span></p><p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">MrCrayfish的枪械模组是一个新颖且令人兴奋的武器模组，具有独特的愿景。添加了九种武器，所有武器都可以高度定制，以创建您自己的独特变体。使用附件和附魔，您可以增加武器的属性，以创建更强大的版本。染料可以用来改变任何武器和附件的颜色。此模组还添加了手榴弹和眩晕手榴弹！</span></em></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">移植版本所做的更改：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">1. 眩晕手榴弹的声音现在是单声道的（参考<a href=\"https://github.com/MrCrayfish/MrCrayfishGunMod/pull/506\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfishGunMod#506</a>，新文件由ffmpeg生成）；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">2. 现在您可以通过将染色的cgm物品浸入装满水的炼药锅中来清洗它；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">3. 弹壳的模型已修正；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">4. 重新装填动画中弹药物品的渲染方向已修复；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">5. 为以下模组实现了额外的兼容性：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-planes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Planes</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">...</span></li></ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果MrCrayfish也更新到了这个版本，您应该<strong>优先使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版模组</a></strong>！</span></p>",
